            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue! Indeed, I can reproduce.\r\n\r\nThe reasoning for this was that the default mappings for both textobject and visual commenting are the same (for historical reasons). As it is not possible to implement with defaults, textobject only works in Operator-pending mode (like after `d`, `c`, etc.).\r\n\r\nI guess the better approach would be to create Visual mode mapping for textobject if keys are different from `mappings.comment_visual`. I'll look into it.",
